---
layout: base.njk
title: Support Culture | Donations for the CAPI Project
description: Support CAPI Samaipata. Your contribution helps us provide art and education to more families in our community.
lang: en
translationKey: "donate"
---

<section class="donar-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="donar-hero__title">Make a difference today</h1>
    <p class="donar-hero__text">
      Your contribution allows art and education to reach more families.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="donacion">
  <div class="container donacion__wrapper">
    <div class="donacion__info">
      <h2 class="donacion__subtitle">Where does your donation go?</h2>
      
      <div class="donacion__impacto">
        <div class="impacto-item">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-guitar"></i>
          <p>
            <strong>Instrument Purchase:</strong> Acquisition of string instruments to ensure that every student has access to one for their practices and rehearsals.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="impacto-item">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-masks-theater"></i>
          <p>
            <strong>Living Culture:</strong> Sustaining festivals, concerts, theater performances, and independent cinema that strengthen Samaipata's social fabric.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="impacto-item">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart"></i>
          <p>
            <strong>Safe Space:</strong> Maintenance and insurance for the facility, guaranteeing a protected environment and the continuity of our operations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="donacion__historia">
        <h3>Stories that inspire</h3>
        <div class="historia-card">
        <div class="historia-card__content">
          <p class="historia-card__texto">
            "Thanks to CAPI, my daughter discovered her passion for music. She now plays the violin and dreams of being part of the youth orchestra."
          </p>
          <div class="historia-card__autor">
          <strong>María Gonzáles</strong>
            <span>Family Mother</span>
          </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
    </div>

    <div class="donacion__form-card">
      <h3>Select an amount</h3>
      <div class="donacion__tipo">
        <button class="btn-tipo is-active" data-tipo="unica">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-heart"></i>
        One-time donation
      </button>
      <button class="btn-tipo" data-tipo="mensual">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-repeat"></i>
        Monthly donation
      </button>
    </div>
      <div class="donacion__grid-montos">
  <button class="btn-monto" data-monto="10">
    <span class="monto-valor">$10</span>
    <span class="monto-descripcion">Materials for 1 student</span>
  </button>
  <button class="btn-monto" data-monto="25">
    <span class="monto-valor">$25</span>
    <span class="monto-descripcion">1 month of art classes</span>
  </button>
  <button class="btn-monto" data-monto="50">
    <span class="monto-valor">$50</span>
    <span class="monto-descripcion">Instrument on loan</span>
  </button>
  <button class="btn-monto" data-monto="100">
    <span class="monto-valor">$100</span>
    <span class="monto-descripcion">Full scholarship for 1 month</span>
  </button>
  <button class="btn-monto btn-monto--custom" id="btn-custom">
    Other amount
  </button>
</div>

      <div class="donacion__custom-input" id="custom-amount-wrapper">
        <div class="input-group">
          <span class="input-group__symbol">$</span>
          <input
            type="number"
            id="custom-amount"
            placeholder="Enter amount"
            min="1"
            step="any"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn btn--primary btn--full" id="btn-donar">
        Continue to donate
      </button>
      <p class="donacion__secure">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> 100% secure and encrypted payment
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="transparencia">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Your donation makes a difference</h2>
    <div class="transparencia__grid">
      <div class="transparencia-item">
        <div class="transparencia-item__numero">85%</div>
        <p>goes directly to educational and artistic programs</p>
      </div>
      <div class="transparencia-item">
        <div class="transparencia-item__numero">150+</div>
        <p>students benefited this year</p>
      </div>
      <div class="transparencia-item">
        <div class="transparencia-item__numero">9</div>
        <p>active programs in the community</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="transparencia__nota">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice"></i>
      We emit tax-deductible receipts for all donations.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

